cryptoauthlib 3.7.9: cross-process tap pad lock for the kit-UART HAL.

Apply AFTER cryptoauthlib-build-fixes.patch and cryptoauthlib-libusb-cdc.patch.
Adds lib/hal/hal_tappad_lock.{c,h} and holds the lock around every kit-UART
transfer. A kit-UART receive transfer is a single byte, so callers MUST hold
hal_tappad_lock() across each calib_* call and every multi-command sequence.
See README-tappad-lock.md next to this file.

